{"title":"IT Consultant Roadmap","role":"IT Consultant","summary":"An IT Consultant helps organizations identify technology problems, evaluate solutions, improve IT systems, and implement technology that supports business objectives.","facts":{"Current degree":"B.Tech / B.E. (Bachelor of Technology / Engineering)","Course":"Information Science & Engineering (ISE)"},"about":[],"intro":[],"horizons":[],"sections":[{"heading":"Overview","kind":"other","blocks":[{"type":"h","text":"Career Overview"},{"type":"p","text":"An IT Consultant helps organizations identify technology problems, evaluate solutions, improve IT systems, and implement technology that supports business objectives."},{"type":"p","text":"The role sits at the intersection of:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Technology","Business Analysis","Problem Solving","Consulting","Project Delivery"],"sep":"+"},{"type":"p","text":"An ISE graduate is well positioned because the specialization provides exposure to software engineering, databases, information systems, networking, cloud computing, data, and business-oriented IT applications."},{"type":"p","text":"A modern IT Consultant should not be limited to recommending software. Strong consultants understand the entire lifecycle:"},{"type":"flow","items":["Business Problem","Requirements","Technology Strategy","Solution Design","Implementation","Adoption","Measurement"]}]},{"heading":"Career Horizons","kind":"horizons","blocks":[{"type":"table","header":["Period","Career Development"],"rows":[[{"text":"2026–2030"},{"text":"Entry-level opportunities in IT consulting, technology consulting, business analysis, implementation consulting and enterprise software"}],[{"text":"2030–2035"},{"text":"Greater specialization in cloud transformation, cybersecurity, data/AI, ERP, enterprise architecture and digital transformation"}],[{"text":"2035–2040"},{"text":"Progression toward Solution Architect, Technology Consultant, Senior Consultant, Engagement Lead or Enterprise Architect"}],